    "title": "'Frustrated' babysitter pleads guilty to murder in death of baby girl - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Deseret Digital Media ,\n5 hours ago MIDVALE — A babysitter accused of smashing a 4-month-old baby's head into the corner of a metal door, resulting in her death, pleaded guilty this week to murder. Zachary Jarred Walton, 30, was charged in 3rd District Court with murder, a first-degree felony, and two counts of aggravated child abuse, a second-degree felony. On Monday, he pleaded guilty to the murder charge. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
